and decrements occupancy;\nhyp-20260905-001-r6s0 micro_opt Replace local saturating-counter arithmetic with thermometer state\n  shifting in one: {q[1:0], 1'b1}. A not-taken hit decrements by shifting\nhyp-20260905-002-r6s1 structural Separate predictor tag validation from ordered metadata commit\n  Selection between comparator results is narrow; do not mux a 26-bit\n  effective tag ahead of one equality comparator. All forwarding is private\n  path, carrying target-valid, index, and target. The target and its metadata\n  with nearly unchanged CoreMark cycles. The added alias comparator,\nhyp-20260905-002-r7s1 structural Move PC-relative address generation across the ID/EX boundary\n  no longer adds a carry chain before EX recovery or predictor-event\nhyp-20260905-001-r8s0 micro_opt Select forwarded JALR targets after parallel operand additions\n  Retain bit-zero carry into bit one and all upper-bit carries, including\n  and forwarding selection follows their carry networks. A rewrite\n  immediate/source fanout, duplicated carry networks, routing cost, or\nhyp-20260905-003-r11s2 predictor Prevalidate sequential and direct-target predictions in decode\n  carry their exact equality results with the instruction. Add two one-bit\n  pc_next, and retain the existing branch comparator, JALR forwarding,\nhyp-20260906-001-r13s0 micro_opt Remove false load-use bubbles with exact late RVFI operand forwarding\n  temporarily carry its older register snapshot, which cannot affect execution.\nhyp-20260906-003-r13s2 predictor Validate sequential predictions from unflushed IF state\n  mismatch comparator. Expect unchanged predictions, recoveries, and\nhyp-20260906-002-r14s1 structural Resolve control flow in MEM from registered forwarded operands\n  Carry the exact accepted predicted_next_pc and decoded immediate into\n  zero. Include carry from bit zero. Set the existing trap control and\n  or introduce MEM trap feedback through the operand forwarding mux.\n\nSYNTH FILES\npnr_seed2