: exact requested ID, predictor category, integer impact, and seven valid short change paths.')\nprint(subprocess.run(['git','status','--short'],check=True,capture_output=True,text=True).stdout.strip())\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
